{
  "$comment": "MangoWC's default keybinds from etc/mango/config.conf of nixpkgs nixos-26.05 `mangowc` (ccyl5fzdvg4ilc7qd8116qjx1hj21dqy-mangowc-0.12.8), the config mango reads from /etc/mango/config.conf (NixOS doesn't link it there). The action is `function,arguments` as the bind line writes it after the key. Mouse, axis and gesture binds and the built-in Ctrl+Alt+F1..F12 VT switches left out (scripts/keybinds/extract-compositors.py).",
